  "notes": "Adds a full Color Studio for easier custom colors: HEX, RGB, and HSL editing; hue/saturation/lightness sliders; derived shade and tint swatches; 48 standard colors including AO3 reds, grayscale, rainbow colors, browns, golds and metallic-like neutrals; recent colors; favorites; copy HEX; and one-click Apply to the currently selected skin color. Adds a palette shortcut beside existing color pickers so any setting can jump straight into Color Studio. Keeps Gradient Studio, GIF support, AO3-style required-tag icons, Split Screen, and all prior tools."
